          values may also be used: ‘UP’=‘1’, ‘DOWN’=‘-1’, ‘LEFT’=‘-1’,
          ‘RIGHT’=‘1’, ‘CENTER’=‘0’.

     ‘padding’ (dimension, in staff space)
